WEBVTT

00:00:16.170 --> 00:00:19.990
We're finally witches!

00:02:09.760 --> 00:02:12.530
What are you doing up so late?

00:02:13.300 --> 00:02:17.240
Starting tomorrow, I won't look like this.

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:19.880
I feel happy and sad at the same time.

00:02:19.880 --> 00:02:22.910
Doremi and the others are finally taking the level 1 exam tomorrow.

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:25.760
But you sure are in a hurry.

00:02:25.760 --> 00:02:29.240
If they don't pass, then they can't change you back.

00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:33.960
No! All the way here, they never gave up.

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.340
I believe that they'll pass.

00:02:36.340 --> 00:02:38.420
I believe in them.

00:02:38.980 --> 00:02:41.330
The level 1 exam, the level 1 exam...

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:53.800
I must get some sleep...

00:02:56.320 --> 00:03:01.040
Once I pass that exam tomorrow, I'll become a full-fledged witch.

00:03:08.340 --> 00:03:10.380
The Final Witch Apprentice Exam.

00:03:14.390 --> 00:03:16.250
I want this one.

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:18.210
Okay.

00:03:19.580 --> 00:03:20.170
Um...

00:03:20.920 --> 00:03:22.320
Jeez Doremi!

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.680
That's my hand.

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.270
Oh no, it broke.

00:03:30.270 --> 00:03:32.230
Ai-chan, be more careful.

00:03:33.030 --> 00:03:34.790
I'll clean it up for you.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:35.940
No, it's okay...

00:03:35.940 --> 00:03:37.900
Let me help you.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.780
Sorry for the noise.

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:45.030
Please come again!

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:49.660
Everyone's all nervous for the exam tonight.

00:03:49.660 --> 00:03:51.040
Right, Majo Rika?

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.500
Now this is just silly.

00:03:56.610 --> 00:03:59.470
Well then, I'll have my lunch too.

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:09.360
~ Good day, sorry for the wait. ~

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:12.060
Why did you come out from my lunchbox!?

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:15.270
What the!? Why are Mota and Motamota here too?

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:18.630
You ask why...?

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:21.740
Today is the day of the level 1 exam...

00:04:21.740 --> 00:04:24.240
But the exam is tonight, right?

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:29.200
Nope... The level 1 exam takes place during the day...

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:32.160
Right here in Misora City...

00:04:33.160 --> 00:04:34.770
Oh...?

00:04:34.770 --> 00:04:37.130
Dela didn't tell you...?

00:04:37.130 --> 00:04:38.590
No, she didn't!

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.490
Oh, I guess I didn't.

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:44.760
We have to close shop!

00:04:44.760 --> 00:04:45.980
Hello.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.720
Onpu-chan, it's terrible!

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:50.930
The exam is in the morning!

00:04:50.930 --> 00:04:52.560
That's why I came.

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:55.460
You didn't know?

00:04:55.460 --> 00:04:56.500
Yeah.

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:59.180
Why is the level 1 exam the only test in the morning?

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:01.840
I thought I could take my level 9 exam!

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.530
I'm going home!

00:05:03.530 --> 00:05:06.880
Well then, right now...

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:09.490
We shall explain the level 1 exam...

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:13.450
My heart is beating so fast!

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:15.610
Calm down, Doremi-chan.

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:18.920
If ya stand firm, you can do it!

00:05:18.920 --> 00:05:20.690
Yeah.

00:05:20.690 --> 00:05:23.920
Anyway, what's the level 1 exam about?

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:29.850
Use magic to do a good deed and have someone say "Thank you" in return...

00:05:30.810 --> 00:05:34.350
The deadline is before sunset...

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:42.220
But if you use magic to alter someone's thoughts and force them to say "Thank you," you will be disqualified...

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:49.230
Understand, Onpu? If you don't pass, I can't turn back.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:50.450
I get it already.

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:56.890
To help the people is what makes a real witch...

00:05:56.890 --> 00:05:58.050
Now then...

00:05:58.050 --> 00:06:00.500
The level 1 exam starts now...!

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:02.930
Alright!

00:06:02.930 --> 00:06:03.990
Yahoo!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:08.380
Do your best, Ojamajos.

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:11.860
Usin' magic to help others and gettin' a thank you in return.

00:06:11.860 --> 00:06:13.040
That's how we pass.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:16.400
That sounds pretty simple. I was super nervous.

00:06:16.400 --> 00:06:17.810
Well then, I'm going on ahead.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.600
We should get started too.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:20.400
Okay!

00:06:20.400 --> 00:06:24.360
All because you guys appeared, I couldn't enjoy my lunch.

00:06:34.480 --> 00:06:35.540
Okay!

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:40.790
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.840
Let the hat appear where that old man gets off!

00:06:56.600 --> 00:06:57.560
Mister!

00:06:57.560 --> 00:06:59.100
Oh, what is it?

00:07:00.240 --> 00:07:02.070
Here, you dropped this.

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:04.030
Oh, my hat.

00:07:04.030 --> 00:07:05.840
You forgot it at the bus stop.

00:07:05.840 --> 00:07:08.070
Oh my, I'm so clumsy.

00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:13.320
But how did you get here before the bus did?

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:15.480
Ah, well, t-t-t-that's because...

00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.680
Did you use magic?

00:07:23.720 --> 00:07:25.340
Where's my thank you?

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:29.260
Someone!

00:07:30.240 --> 00:07:31.220
Stop it!

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:40.430
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:42.900
Stop that baby carriage!

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.390
Thank goodness, my baby's safe.

00:07:51.390 --> 00:07:52.610
Thank goodness.

00:07:54.570 --> 00:07:57.910
Ya can't say that I helped her usin' magic.

00:07:58.680 --> 00:07:59.540
Thank goodness.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:06.970
What's this trash doing all scattered about?

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:07.890
Um...

00:08:08.480 --> 00:08:10.640
Let me help you.

00:08:10.640 --> 00:08:13.010
You can take a break, ma'am.

00:08:13.010 --> 00:08:15.350
Ah, that's very nice of you.

00:08:15.350 --> 00:08:17.970
I need to go watch my grandchild play.

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.830
Take care.

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:22.520
Okay, here I go.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.140
Um... This is combustible.

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.400
And this isn't.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:29.260
Okay.

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:32.030
Oh my, you're all done.

00:08:32.030 --> 00:08:33.990
Good job, and thank you.

00:08:35.320 --> 00:08:37.050
Thank you?

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:39.990
She said thank you!

00:08:44.770 --> 00:08:47.460
I forgot to use magic!

00:08:47.460 --> 00:08:49.800
I want a lollipop!

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.760
No, come on now!

00:08:53.360 --> 00:08:57.800
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:08:57.800 --> 00:09:00.930
Lollipop, come out!

00:09:03.310 --> 00:09:05.110
No, no, no, no!

00:09:05.110 --> 00:09:06.130
You can have this.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:09.230
I'm sorry, he has cavities.

00:09:09.230 --> 00:09:10.290
Now, come on.

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:12.780
Saki Dental Clinic

00:09:14.770 --> 00:09:16.200
It's Onpu-chan!

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.470
Wow, it's really her!

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:23.620
Ahh, I have important work to do...

00:09:27.120 --> 00:09:29.390
It wasn't a fire...

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:31.540
Hey, don't fly away!

00:09:31.540 --> 00:09:34.140
Ah, Doremi-chan, catch that bird!

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:35.450
Okay, leave it to me.

00:09:45.950 --> 00:09:47.310
Here, take this.

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:50.230
T-Thank you.

00:09:50.230 --> 00:09:52.780
Why am I the one saying that?

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:55.430
Eh? It's Harukaze-san.

00:09:55.430 --> 00:09:57.290
Yer so clumsy.

00:09:57.290 --> 00:09:58.450
Doremi-chan, ya alright?

00:09:58.450 --> 00:09:59.910
W-What's that!?

00:10:01.220 --> 00:10:02.580
I blew it there.

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.210
Get a grip.

00:10:04.210 --> 00:10:04.980
Okay.

00:10:04.980 --> 00:10:06.120
No one saw us, right?

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.560
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:10:31.150 --> 00:10:32.610
Ai-chan, let's go!

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:33.560
Okay!

00:10:37.210 --> 00:10:38.810
I saw them.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.750
I saw something incredible.

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:44.580
I-I must tell someone!

00:10:44.580 --> 00:10:48.080
It's a scoop! A huge scoop!

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:20.240
Harukaze-san and Senoo-san are flying around in the sky on brooms?

00:11:20.240 --> 00:11:24.300
Yes, it's true! I saw them!

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.030
How's that possib-!?

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.100
Actually, I saw something too.

00:11:35.100 --> 00:11:38.590
Onpu-chan just flew by not long ago.

00:11:38.590 --> 00:11:41.100
Eh? Segawa-san too?

00:11:41.100 --> 00:11:43.590
You're our class rep, do something!

00:11:46.060 --> 00:11:48.210
Ah, Nanako-chan?

00:11:48.210 --> 00:11:52.890
Hey, did you hear about this? Someone saw Doremi-chan and the others flying in the sky!

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:55.370
They're like witches.

00:11:55.370 --> 00:11:58.030
Did you hear about it? Harukaze and the others are witches.

00:12:00.100 --> 00:12:03.320
Eh? Doremi and a witch...? What did you say?

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:09.750
Doremi-chan and the others caught a witch and locked her up in the Maho-dou.

00:12:11.120 --> 00:12:13.290
Whoa! Blew me away like a bibimbap!

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.210
Doremi and the others were kidnapped by a witch! Tempura!

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:20.170
They're locked up inside the Maho-dou!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:21.560
Wh-!?

00:12:22.100 --> 00:12:24.340
What did you say!?

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:26.300
Wait right there!

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.420
Lady Hadzuki!

00:12:28.420 --> 00:12:32.620
I'll save you, even if it costs my own life!

00:12:32.620 --> 00:12:35.390
Just you wait!

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:38.470
Old lady, what're ya doin'!?

00:12:38.470 --> 00:12:40.690
It's dangerous to swing those things around!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:45.670
Let me go! I must go! I must go!

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:46.700
Baaya?

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:01.700
Doremi-chan!

00:13:02.450 --> 00:13:05.100
Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan, how did it go?

00:13:05.100 --> 00:13:06.060
No good.

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:08.500
No one's willin' to say thank you.

00:13:08.510 --> 00:13:11.470
If we don't hurry, the exam will be over.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:12.510
Yeah.

00:13:12.510 --> 00:13:14.640
We must try our best until the end.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:15.690
Before that.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.340
Look at your own Poron.

00:13:18.340 --> 00:13:20.700
Ahh! I only have one magic sphere left.

00:13:20.700 --> 00:13:21.460
Me too.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:22.650
Me too!

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.860
How about you, Onpu-chan?

00:13:25.800 --> 00:13:29.330
This means that we can only cast magic one more time.

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:33.280
If we fail, then we fail the level 1 exam.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:34.960
One chance, huh...

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:36.750
Talk about pressure.

00:13:36.750 --> 00:13:38.770
Let's go back to the city.

00:13:38.770 --> 00:13:40.710
We can't get anything done in the mountains.

00:13:41.200 --> 00:13:42.220
Yeah.

00:13:47.710 --> 00:13:48.720
Doremi-chan!

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.470
I'll save you right now!

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:53.930
You're on your last sphere!

00:13:55.710 --> 00:13:59.100
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:02.050
Save that fox!

00:14:13.820 --> 00:14:16.700
There, it's okay now, you must be cold...

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:28.760
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:14:28.760 --> 00:14:31.350
Fire, come out!

00:14:35.720 --> 00:14:40.020
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:42.220
Towel, come out!

00:14:47.400 --> 00:14:50.040
Thank you, Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:52.850
It's to save a life.

00:14:52.850 --> 00:14:53.870
Yeah, yeah.

00:14:59.500 --> 00:15:00.690
What is it?

00:15:00.690 --> 00:15:02.290
You shouldn't be cold anymore.

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:12.220
Pururun Purun Famifami Faa!

00:15:12.220 --> 00:15:14.810
Milk, come out!

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:24.570
It was hungry.

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:26.570
Onpu-chan!

00:15:31.990 --> 00:15:33.880
Ah, it's its mom.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:40.960
Thank goodness.

00:15:44.480 --> 00:15:46.380
Don't fall into the river again!

00:15:46.380 --> 00:15:49.670
Goodbye! Take care!

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:10.780
The sun is setting.

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.980
We've used up the last of our magic spheres.

00:16:13.980 --> 00:16:16.280
We've failed the level 1 exam.

00:16:16.910 --> 00:16:18.740
Oh well, we'll get another chance.

00:16:19.520 --> 00:16:21.740
Doing that felt really good, though.

00:16:22.340 --> 00:16:23.700
Okay..!

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:25.210
The exam is over...

00:16:25.210 --> 00:16:30.050
Thank you all... The four of you all pass...

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.720
Eh? We passed!?

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:32.510
How!?

00:16:32.510 --> 00:16:38.840
Well, that fox just now said "thank you..."

00:16:42.660 --> 00:16:44.770
So it was the fox!

00:16:45.300 --> 00:16:46.660
Yes!

00:16:46.660 --> 00:16:50.320
We passed the level 1 exam!

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:51.140
Yeah!

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:53.580
We're witches!

00:17:07.030 --> 00:17:09.660
You've all done well.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:10.420
Congratulations.

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:14.880
I shall now give you your spheres of certification.

00:17:25.380 --> 00:17:26.300
Yes!

00:17:26.300 --> 00:17:28.060
It's finally full!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:33.940
W-What's going on?

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:36.450
What's this?

00:17:37.120 --> 00:17:38.370
Is it a bead?

00:17:38.900 --> 00:17:41.870
Those are a witch's Crystal.

00:17:42.820 --> 00:17:43.830
Crystal?

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:46.540
Then it's the same as Majo Rika's?

00:17:46.540 --> 00:17:48.920
But it's so puny.

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:52.430
From this day forth, the four of you are all witches.

00:17:52.880 --> 00:17:58.840
But you are still new witches, so that's why your Crystals are so small.

00:17:59.600 --> 00:18:03.350
Please continue doing your best so that your Crystals can grow.

00:18:03.980 --> 00:18:07.270
Well then, I want to give you witch clothes too.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.520
Eh? Witch clothes?

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:14.740
You've been wearing apprentice uniforms, but you are all wonderful witches now.

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:17.720
Witch... I'm a witch.

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:19.020
Doremi-chan.

00:18:19.020 --> 00:18:20.140
Ya did it!

00:18:20.760 --> 00:18:21.940
Ai-chan!

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:24.600
Hadzuki-chan!

00:18:28.880 --> 00:18:30.580
Doremi-chan.

00:18:33.420 --> 00:18:34.670
An idol witch.

00:18:35.920 --> 00:18:37.170
That's not too shabby.

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:42.600
W-Who are you?

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:45.060
Are you Onpu-chan's mother?

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:47.120
Y-Yes, I am.

00:18:47.120 --> 00:18:50.020
Can you give me some words regarding this incident?

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.500
Yes, this is Harukaze.

00:18:55.530 --> 00:18:57.490
Oh, Hadzuki-chan's mother?

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:00.390
Huh?

00:19:00.390 --> 00:19:01.950
Doremi was kidnapped?

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:11.580
Our children are all trapped inside the Maho-dou!

00:19:15.500 --> 00:19:17.240
What happened?

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:18.580
I'm going to the Maho-dou.

00:19:18.580 --> 00:19:20.010
Eh? Why?

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:21.970
That's enough, you stay at home.

00:19:21.970 --> 00:19:25.930
No, I can't do that. You can't go now!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:29.140
Wait! I'm going too!

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:34.010
I'm so happy!

00:19:34.010 --> 00:19:38.200
I can finally get rid of this ugly appearance!

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.640
I wonder about that.

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:40.560
W-What?

00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:43.230
You're pretty cute like that.

00:19:43.230 --> 00:19:44.830
I think you should keep that look up.

00:19:47.540 --> 00:19:50.890
W-W-W-What are you saying!?

00:19:50.890 --> 00:19:53.850
Onpu! Onpu-sama...

00:19:53.850 --> 00:19:55.390
Turn me back.

00:19:56.340 --> 00:19:57.420
I'm joking.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:00.090
Onpu-chan.

00:20:00.640 --> 00:20:01.660
What?

00:20:01.660 --> 00:20:05.600
You didn't use magic to alter people's thoughts during the exam.

00:20:05.600 --> 00:20:06.510
Yeah.

00:20:06.510 --> 00:20:07.970
How do you feel?

00:20:11.000 --> 00:20:11.940
I feel nice!

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:23.610
Somehow, please have Doremi and the others back already.

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.380
Doremi, Doremi! Are you there?

00:20:27.380 --> 00:20:28.350
Doremi!

00:20:28.350 --> 00:20:30.350
They're not back yet.

00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.210
Onpu-chan!

00:20:33.210 --> 00:20:34.000
Doremi!

00:20:34.000 --> 00:20:35.000
Please move aside!

00:20:41.700 --> 00:20:43.510
Lady Hadzuki!

00:20:44.900 --> 00:20:46.090
Aiko!

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:48.830
Doremi!

00:20:48.830 --> 00:20:50.510
Hadzuki-chan!

00:20:50.510 --> 00:20:52.020
Onpu-chan, where are you?

00:20:54.220 --> 00:20:56.560
W-What? No one's here.

00:20:56.560 --> 00:20:59.300
They must be on their way back home.

00:20:59.300 --> 00:21:00.190
Doremi!

00:21:02.900 --> 00:21:04.860
Why are you all here!?

00:21:09.620 --> 00:21:10.700
Doremi?

00:21:11.310 --> 00:21:12.520
We're almost there.

00:21:13.340 --> 00:21:15.500
I can see the exit.

00:21:17.960 --> 00:21:21.240
D-Doremi is not here! Let's go home now!

00:21:21.240 --> 00:21:23.470
Why are you so nervous, Pop?

00:21:25.400 --> 00:21:26.890
Ahh, I'm so hungry...

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:29.270
Move.

00:21:35.260 --> 00:21:36.020
Doremi?

00:21:37.020 --> 00:21:37.810
Why!?

00:21:37.810 --> 00:21:38.960
Aiko!

00:21:38.960 --> 00:21:39.940
Hadzuki-chan!

00:21:39.940 --> 00:21:40.980
Dad!

00:21:40.980 --> 00:21:41.940
Don't look at us!

00:21:45.380 --> 00:21:47.060
What is this?

00:21:47.680 --> 00:21:48.910
Onpu-chan?

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:50.720
We've been found out!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.080
We've laughed together...

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:03.960
Got angry together...

00:22:03.960 --> 00:22:04.910
Cried together...

00:22:04.910 --> 00:22:06.070
And sighed together...

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:08.580
It's been fun, everyone.

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:11.130
We had a lot of fun this year.

00:22:11.130 --> 00:22:12.160
Hadzuki-chan.

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:13.050
Ai-chan.

00:22:13.050 --> 00:22:14.100
Onpu-chan.

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:15.160
Doremi-chan.

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:16.900
Everyone, thank you.

00:22:16.900 --> 00:22:21.430
We couldn't become witches, but we'll always be friends.

00:22:21.430 --> 00:22:22.510
Yes!

00:22:22.510 --> 00:22:23.570
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.570 --> 00:22:25.410
Goodbye, Maho-dou.

00:22:25.410 --> 00:22:28.340
Cast the last magic for everyone!
